; ; ------------------------------------------------------------------
; ; resource_invalidate_gameplay_vram_cache
; ; Outputs:
; ;   none
; ; Clobbers:
; ;   AF
; ; Notes:
; ;   Use this when a fullscreen effect or presentation screen overwrites
; ;   shared gameplay/font VRAM tables outside the normal loaders.
; ; ------------------------------------------------------------------
