; ; ------------------------------------------------------------------
; ; resource_invalidate_screen_ram_cache
; ; Outputs:
; ;   none
; ; Clobbers:
; ;   AF
; ; Notes:
; ;   Invalidates the clean RAM copies used to rebuild runtime screen data
; ;   without re-reading the same banked resource on repeated screen loads.
